#: pybroker.optimize.OptimizeMixin.optimize:53
msgid ""
"Number of bars in the future of the target prediction. Held out between "
"train and test to prevent training data from leaking across the boundary,"
" in the bars of the timeframe each model is fitted on: a model bound to "
"an interval with :meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` holds out "
"``lookahead`` bars of that interval, not of the base timeframe. Defaults "
"to ``1``."
